category: Net
requires: cygwin libbrotlidec1 libiconv2 libssl3 libzstd1 zlib0
sdesc: "HTTrack Website Copier, copy websites to your computer (runtime)"
ldesc: "HTTrack is an offline browser utility, allowing you to download a World Wide
website from the Internet to a local directory, building recursively all
directories, getting html, images, and other files from the server to your
computer."
external-source: httrack

